  "phase3_gemini_self_healing": {
    "forensics": "The losing cluster exposes two main failure modes: morning reversals on 10:25 AM entries (INFY, TATASTEEL) where 0.65% stops were swept during post-opening consolidation, and late-session exhaustion (13:45-14:15 entries) that lacked the momentum to reach the 1.45% target before EOD square-off. Furthermore, Trades #3 and #7 demonstrate severe fee drag, where stagnant price action near breakeven resulted in net losses due to transaction costs consuming 67% of gross cycle edge.",
