    "plan_update_summary": "### Cycle #31 Update: Mitigating EOD Fee Drag & Post-Open Whipsaws\nOut-of-sample testing with DeepSeek V4.1 Flash achieved net profitability (PF: 1.26, Win Rate: 55.6%), but fee drag (\u20b933.30 fees vs \u20b916.24 net P&L) and time-of-day microstructure traps limited upside. Forensic analysis of the four losses revealed 10:25 IST entries getting stopped out during post-open consolidation and afternoon entries (post-13:45 IST) stalling into `EOD_SQUARE_OFF`. To harden the strategy, we are raising `min_sweep_vol_multiplier` to 2.75x to demand true institutional participation, widening `min_sl_pct` to 0.70% to survive morning noise, and tightening `min_target_pct` to 1.35% alongside an earlier `breakeven_trigger_r` of 0.95R to lock in gains before late-session decay."
